  ],
  "note2": "match = which oracle finding kinds on which route count as detecting the bug (a bug may surface as several symptoms, e.g. a dead click that also throws). Written before the oracle existed. A confirmed finding that matches no ENABLED bug is a false positive.",
  "note3": "ERRATA (post dev-run, see errata.json): match scope widened for shop-layout-overflow (also visible on /products?category=) and tasks-failing-api (the app also logs the failure via console.error). The ORIGINAL strict rules (committed before the oracle existed) are kept as `matchOriginal` on those bugs, and the evaluator reports recall under both rule sets."
}